<title>USA: United Stationers to buy wholesaler.</title>
<headline>United Stationers to buy wholesaler.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Stationers Inc said Tuesday its United Stationers Supply unit has signed an agreement to acquire  Lagasse Brothers Inc, an $80 million wholesaler of janitorial and sanitary supplies.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Lagasse is headquartered in New Orleans.</p>
<p>United Stationers is a wholesaler of business products.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
